<div class="msc-learn-term"><dt>Custody</dt><dd>Control over the keys or authorization needed to move bitcoin.</dd></div>
<div class="msc-learn-term"><dt>Threat model</dt><dd>A defined view of the assets, adversaries, capabilities, failure modes, and assumptions relevant to a security decision.</dd></div>
<div class="msc-learn-term"><dt>Multisig</dt><dd>A spending condition requiring a defined threshold of multiple keys to authorize a transaction.</dd></div>
<div class="msc-learn-term"><dt>Seed phrase</dt><dd>A human-readable backup representation used by many wallets to derive keys under a wallet standard.</dd></div>
